OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer who pulled braid out of
OL,4,Aex's head sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footballer who pleaded guilty to
OL,7,Fassault after pulling a braid out of
OL,8,Fhis ex-girlfriend's head during an
OL,9,Fargument has been fined and sentenced
OL,10,Fto community service.
OL,12,FFormer Bournemouth and Liverpool player
OL,13,FJordon Ibe, 30, attacked Amie Mayson
OL,14,Foutside her home in Lambeth, south
OL,15,FLondon, in December.
OL,17,FThe former England under-21
OL,18,Finternational, from Chislehurst,
OL,19,Fsouth-east London, changed his plea to
OL,20,Fguilty, having denied the charge of
OL,21,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,22,Fin March.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
