OL,3,GNEWSAFootballer who pulled braid out of
OL,4,Aex's head sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FCroydon Magistrates' Court heard Ibe
OL,7,Fpulled a braid from Mayson's head,
OL,8,Fleaving her with a bald patch. The
OL,9,Ffootballer, who represented himself,
OL,10,Ftold the court on Friday: "I made a
OL,11,Fserious mistake."
